OL,3,GNEWSAGB sprinter hails 'dream come
OL,4,Atrue' senior debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 19-year-old sprinter said reaching
OL,7,Fthe semi-finals of the European
OL,8,FAthletics Championships was "a dream
OL,9,Fcome true".
OL,11,FEbuka Nwokeji, from Northampton,
OL,12,Fcompeted in the men's 200m race during
OL,13,Fhis first tournament as a senior
OL,14,FBritish international in August.
OL,16,FHe was the youngest male athlete
OL,17,Fselected for Great Britain's team in
OL,18,FBirmingham and clocked 20.83 seconds,
OL,19,Ffinishing sixth in his semi-final heat.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
